<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Tantalum: third-party licenses</title>
<style>
body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 900px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 16px; color: #1a1e24; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f2f4f7; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; }
li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>Tantalum is MIT-licensed. These are the licenses of the Rust crates built into it. The C code
built into it (Lua, lzf, fpconv and parts of Redis 7.2.4) is in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>Licenses</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
  <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
